              "short": "$\\varnothing$, $\\{a\\}$, $\\{b\\}$, $\\{a,b\\}$.",
              "worked": "List subsets by their number of elements:\n\n0 elements: $\\varnothing$.\n\n1 element: $\\{a\\}$, $\\{b\\}$.\n\n2 elements: $\\{a,b\\}$.\n\nThere are $1+2+1=4$ subsets.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
